      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOLD THRUSTER (1) has a strong record this trip with two wins and three placings from six starts. Recorded a 1.75 lengths win (30.03) in a Mix 6/7 last time at The Meadows. Looks suited here and rates on top. CANYA TALK NOW (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at The Meadows in a handy 29.67 beating Maxi Grin. Won at his only start from this draw. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. LIL REX (6) shapes well for this backing up a flying 34.19 win with success at Murray Bridge over 680m last time, recording 39.06. Has the ability and can measure up again. SPRINGVALE MAGIC (4) has strong credentials over this journey.",
